    ]
  },
  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "Apple’s leadership split, Coca-Cola’s formula reversal and plans for a weaker dollar all attracted attention.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "Different companies followed very different paths. Size and reputation did not guarantee high returns, and a bad headline did not settle a company’s future.",
    "what_faded_away": "The immediate tax-bill timetable and the first reactions to a new musical did not determine the final ranking.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "No starting headline revealed that Apple and Coca-Cola would end so close together. Their past difficulties were clues to consider, not a ready-made answer.",
